{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And I took</b> — Then Zerubbabel died, he being נועם, who had a covenant with all the nations around Jerusalem, a covenant of peace; and this is <b>and I broke it</b>." "And the sense of <b>my covenant</b>: because the land that the nations swore to Zerubbabel is the land of HaShem."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:46.431428290Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}